---
description: Culture Context software factory rules
globs:
  - "**/*"
---

Read `factory/CONTRACT.md`, `factory/PROJECT.md`, and `specs/culture-context-mvp.md` before building.

- Edge (Next/mobile) renders and validates. It does not scrape sources or decide applicability.
- Python owns adapters, normalization, provenance, and briefs.
- A user-facing law or restriction must include a source record. Missing source is unavailable, not permission to invent.
- Government advisories stay advisories. Do not upgrade source class.
- AI may explain curated records. It must not create a law or silently change a source class.
- Do not put passport numbers or travel-document images in the traveler profile.
